1077 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1078 0 R/Alt(Two mirrored sides of equal size, the agent on the left and people on the right. The agent holds two boxes, Model (reasons) and Knowledge (engrams). People mirror it with Knowledge (what they know) and Mind (reasons), so the two Knowledge boxes face each other in the middle, joined by a two-way arrow labelled Working together: pairing, observing, correcting. Below each side, two inputs join into one arrow into its Knowledge, never into the Model or the Mind. From the left: the agent's Onboarding (docs, code, history) on the outside and Experience (its own actions) under its Knowledge, then people's Experience (years of work) under their Knowledge and Education (school, books, craft) on the outside. Above both, spanning the full width, is a band labelled Reflection: a topic presented, discussed and put to the test; both bring what they know, both leave knowing more. Two-way arrows join it to each side.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 11580 0 R>>
endobj
