1163 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 1164 0 R/Alt(Two panels side by side. Left, fluid intelligence: reasons in the moment, keeps nothing, holding a model and a person, both fluid minds. Right, crystalline intelligence: accumulates and keeps what the company taught, holding engrams in domains, plain markdown on disk. An arrow labelled teach, capture runs straight from the left panel to the right one, and an arrow labelled recall runs straight back. Between the panels, clear of both arrows, sits a box labelled Fluid, the web UI, where they meet on reflections, joined to the left panel by a two-way arrow. A short dashed arrow labelled inspect leads from it into the right panel.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 11589 0 R>>
endobj
