3792 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 3793 0 R/Alt(On a laptop, the agent harness, its hooks and the CLI talk over the socket to the local Crystalline. It offers your domains and the team's, each from its one source, and keeps a small cache of answers. A signed-in HTTPS connection joins it to the team server's domains, and a dashed one to another server if you add one. The team server also has MCP for agents that connect to it directly, and Fluid, which a colleague uses in a browser.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[12]/Pg 11725 0 R>>
endobj
