<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 4375 0 R/Alt(Kane, who asks in a thread, sends a question to the thread on the Dune page, which carries no source check. The thread passes it to the scheduled reflect run on club, which is unattended and reads and writes club only. From the run one arrow goes down to club, which the run reads; another ends at a bar before committee, marked hidden from this run. A third arrow leads from the run to the answer in the thread, drawn from club only, with the question left open for a person. From the answer an arrow leads to a wide box: everyone who reads the page, and everyone who can read dallas/book-club through the backup branch.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[34]/Pg 11762 0 R>>
endobj
